    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406">

                <pb facs="1057" n="1025" xml:id="pg1025"/>

                <head>406. Memorandum From the Counselor of the Department of State and Chairman of
                    the Policy Planning Council (Rostow) to President Kennedy<anchor n="0" xml:id="d406-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1962-09-03">September 3,
                        1962</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>At your request, I have reviewed the Cuban position over the week end. Herewith
                    my reflections. You will understand, of course, that I have not been following
                    the matter closely over recent months.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold"
                        >WR</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d406-a1.xml" xpointer="d406-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
